'''Masked Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 1.5 Update|Version 1.5]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. It was only obtainable via [[Serial Codes]] and must be obtained from the Nyanko Daisensou Lottery Double Chance Campaign. As of [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]], it became impossible to obtain this unit due to the feature to input serial codes were removed. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it became obtainable by opening the game between 10 p.m. and 11:59 p.m.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 29
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Masked Cat
|name2 = Luchador Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Luchador Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meat shield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role without relevant differences in quality. Masked Cat, however, can be used in 4-crown stages, where there is considerably less competition. This is his only use.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Due to the low stats, this form is not recommended as it is considerably worse than any possible alternative in about every way, resulting in him being a bad investment of money. Could still be of use in early-mid [[Empire of Cats]], but, after that, it is best to revert this cat to Normal Form and only use that.

{{Job|EvolvedClass = Melee|Classification = Meatshield|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

